{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallbound is a fantasy-themed, challenging parkour game. The witch has teleported our character to the very top. It\u2019s up to us to escape her curse by avoiding traps and obstacles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When playing together, all players must reach the end of the course to clear the stage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can interact with emotes (dancing, laughing, clapping, etc.).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can push your friends and make them fall down.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD \u2013 Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space \u2013 Jump</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LShift \u2013 Run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C \u2013 Emote Wheel</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884380?t=1753269462","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884380?t=1753269462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884380/5fcc7401deab9531a26b0e5d616ef10bab2f00cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753269462","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884380/5fcc7401deab9531a26b0e5d616ef10bab2f00cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753269462","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"